      },
      "text": "第一条",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2550326827304815,
        "y0": 0.5727903963339449,
        "x1": 0.8820718752792458,
        "y1": 0.58794191148546
      },
      "text": "为了保障网络安全，维护网络空间主权和国家安全、社会公共利益，保护",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.6030934266369752,
        "x1": 0.8039624207939198,
        "y1": 0.6182449417884903
      },
      "text": "公民、法人和其他组织的合法权益，促进经济社会信息化健康发展，制定本法。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15612745596692454,
        "y0": 0.6333964569400055,
        "x1": 0.2153431512171926,
        "y1": 0.6485479720915206
      },
      "text": "第二条",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2550326827304815,
        "y0": 0.6333964569400055,
        "x1": 0.8820718752792458,
        "y1": 0.6485479720915206
      },
      "text": "在中华人民共和国境内建设、运营、维护和使用网络，以及网络安全的监",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.6637247451628097,
        "x1": 0.2941584867589614,
        "y1": 0.6788762603143249
      },
      "text": "督管理，适用本法。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15612745596692454,
        "y0": 0.69402777546584,
        "x1": 0.2153431512171926,
        "y1": 0.7091792906173552
      },
      "text": "第三条",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2550326827304815,
        "y0": 0.69402777546584,
        "x1": 0.8820718752792458,
        "y1": 0.7091792906173552
      },
      "text": "国家坚持网络安全与信息化发展并重，遵循积极利用、科学发展、依法管",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.7243308057688703,
        "x1": 0.8823938432082631,
        "y1": 0.7394823209203856
      },
      "text": "理、确保安全的方针，推进网络基础设施建设和互联互通，鼓励网络技术创新和应用，支",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.7546717133184876,
        "x1": 0.7843545776566648,
        "y1": 0.7698232284700027
      },
      "text": "持培养网络安全人才，建立健全网络安全保障体系，提高网络安全保护能力。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15612745596692454,
        "y0": 0.784974743621518,
        "x1": 0.2153431512171926,
        "y1": 0.8001262587730331
      },
      "text": "第四条",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2550326827304815,
        "y0": 0.784974743621518,
        "x1": 0.8820718752792458,
        "y1": 0.8001262587730331
      },
      "text": "国家制定并不断完善网络安全战略，明确保障网络安全的基本要求和主要",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.8152777739245483,
        "x1": 0.6078840392866945,
        "y1": 0.8304292890760634
      },
      "text": "目标，提出重点领域的网络安全政策、工作任务和措施。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768791098999822,
        "y0": 0.8771780283764156,
        "x1": 0.8664126053355099,
